WEBVTT

01:29.560 --> 01:32.979
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.600 --> 01:36.180
[Episode 16]

01:36.759 --> 01:43.220
[High Art]

01:42.880 --> 01:44.320
You're back, Yanzhi.

01:44.320 --> 01:44.770
Shh.

01:44.789 --> 01:45.550
How did it go?

01:46.800 --> 01:47.400
Who was it?

01:47.759 --> 01:48.720
Was it Wan Hongliu?

01:48.720 --> 01:50.200
It has nothing to do with Wan Hongliu.

01:50.200 --> 01:51.130
Not Wan Hongliu?

01:52.320 --> 01:53.180
Then who was it?

01:56.070 --> 01:57.240
Anyway, rest assured.

01:57.240 --> 01:58.150
Tonight,

01:58.170 --> 01:59.900
no one will bother us anymore.

01:59.920 --> 02:02.030
Let's go back and get some rest,

02:02.050 --> 02:04.710
so we can do our best
in the final round tomorrow.

02:06.090 --> 02:06.730
My Lady,

02:07.370 --> 02:09.080
are you satisfied this time?

02:09.199 --> 02:11.200
I often hear my father praising you.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.710
You certainly live up to your reputation.

02:12.710 --> 02:14.240
Thank you for the compliment, My Lady.

02:14.240 --> 02:15.840
I don't deserve it.

02:17.090 --> 02:18.850
Forgive my presumption.

02:19.160 --> 02:21.520
If you hate a female prisoner,

02:21.640 --> 02:23.600
I can take care of her for you.

02:23.840 --> 02:25.800
Why did you come here in person?

02:26.000 --> 02:28.079
Is it just for amusement?

02:28.100 --> 02:29.700
At first, I just wanted to see

02:30.040 --> 02:31.820
what kind of person she is.

02:32.000 --> 02:33.360
But I didn't expect

02:33.600 --> 02:35.160
that at death's door,

02:35.190 --> 02:36.720
she would still dare to talk back to me.

02:36.720 --> 02:37.850
That is outrageous.

02:38.760 --> 02:41.160
Since this female prisoner
shows no remorse,

02:41.160 --> 02:42.360
why don't we...

02:42.360 --> 02:42.920
No.

02:42.920 --> 02:44.160
Let her climb.

02:44.560 --> 02:47.220
The higher she climbs,
the harder she will fall.

02:47.520 --> 02:48.840
You mean...

02:49.780 --> 02:51.880
Let her finish the last round
of the death match.

02:51.880 --> 02:53.160
I want to see

02:53.590 --> 02:55.250
what she's really capable of.

03:16.990 --> 03:20.760
[High Art]

03:32.280 --> 03:32.560
Hey,

03:32.560 --> 03:33.800
wait for me!

03:34.280 --> 03:34.880
Hurry up!

03:38.240 --> 03:39.440
I was worried,

03:39.820 --> 03:40.760
so I came back.

03:45.440 --> 03:46.940
In this Lingya Tower,

03:48.000 --> 03:49.960
those are just illusions

03:51.000 --> 03:52.760
meant to numb people.

03:54.640 --> 03:55.970
The more it is like this,

03:56.800 --> 03:58.530
the more dangerous it becomes.

04:00.720 --> 04:02.400
They are living human beings.

04:03.480 --> 04:05.080
They shouldn't be here

04:05.360 --> 04:07.360
to be treated as playthings.

04:32.159 --> 04:33.360
Do you think

04:33.360 --> 04:34.720
they would dare to shoot the arrows?

04:34.720 --> 04:36.159
I don't think they'd dare.

04:36.159 --> 04:37.760
They are sisters, after all.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.360
People who come here

04:39.360 --> 04:40.980
are capable of anything.

04:41.010 --> 04:42.340
If you don't believe it,

04:42.960 --> 04:44.159
look for yourselves.

04:51.200 --> 04:52.560
They're really ruthless.

04:52.560 --> 04:53.560
Yeah.

04:54.560 --> 04:55.300
Oh.

04:55.330 --> 04:57.600
I'll bet on the Red Team
for today's three rounds.

04:57.600 --> 04:59.300
I still have faith in Voice-Keeper.

04:59.300 --> 05:00.300
Me too.

05:01.120 --> 05:04.350
I wonder what you think
about this round, Miss?

05:05.320 --> 05:07.650
I'll still bet
on the same one as last time.

05:23.280 --> 05:24.080
Not me.

05:26.080 --> 05:28.120
They lost points,
so we don't need to shoot.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.270
Yeah.

05:41.600 --> 05:42.360
So accurate.

05:42.480 --> 05:43.280
Yeah.

05:50.200 --> 05:51.130
For the Red Team,

05:51.350 --> 05:54.200
two points deducted
for spilling the shimmering elixir,

05:54.200 --> 05:56.600
and five points added
for hitting the jade bead.

05:56.600 --> 05:58.640
A total of three points.

05:58.800 --> 06:00.280
Blue Team, get ready.

06:01.400 --> 06:02.960
It seems we need to change our plan.

06:02.960 --> 06:04.580
If we want to beat the Red Team,

06:04.580 --> 06:06.240
we have to shoot our arrows.

06:06.680 --> 06:08.010
That's our only choice.

06:08.040 --> 06:08.840
Tuya,

06:09.400 --> 06:10.440
I'm not good at archery.

06:10.440 --> 06:12.040
I'm afraid I'll knock it over
or hurt someone.

06:12.040 --> 06:14.200
I'll leave the scoring to you later.

06:14.790 --> 06:15.590
Okay.

08:04.480 --> 08:06.200
No, I'm not sure I can do it.

08:06.840 --> 08:08.300
Nan Yanzhi believes in us.

08:08.840 --> 08:10.700
We must believe in ourselves too.

08:11.320 --> 08:12.120
Okay.

08:12.700 --> 08:13.960
Believe in ourselves.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.270
Hit!

08:43.240 --> 08:44.200
See?

08:44.400 --> 08:45.640
I was right, wasn't I?

09:00.800 --> 09:02.680
Are they really going to win?

09:02.830 --> 09:03.630
Impossible.

09:03.760 --> 09:07.020
I've never seen Voice-Keeper lose
in the Hall of Elegance.

09:08.120 --> 09:10.500
You are nothing but a convicted prisoner

09:10.680 --> 09:12.680
who cannot even leave Lingya Tower.

09:12.690 --> 09:16.190
Why should I believe you can
help me find the real culprit?

09:16.410 --> 09:18.140
What if I can leave this Lingya Tower?

09:18.140 --> 09:20.680
I'm afraid you won't survive
tomorrow's death match,

09:20.680 --> 09:22.430
let alone leave this Lingya Tower.

09:22.430 --> 09:23.230
Alright.

09:24.080 --> 09:25.470
How about we make a bet?

09:25.560 --> 09:27.380
If we meet outside in the future,

09:27.440 --> 09:29.930
I will help you find the real culprit
who killed your husband,

09:29.930 --> 09:31.830
and you promise to do me a favor.

09:32.440 --> 09:33.300
How about that?

09:33.360 --> 09:34.840
What a pipe dream.

09:35.040 --> 09:36.100
We can discuss this

09:36.200 --> 09:37.880
after you leave Lingya Tower

09:38.080 --> 09:39.320
and come find me.

09:40.800 --> 09:41.640
It's a deal.

09:44.550 --> 09:45.360
Bow.

09:51.780 --> 09:53.800
I, Nan Yanzhi...

09:53.880 --> 09:55.040
I, Jiang Man...

09:55.400 --> 09:58.040
-...pray that Heaven blesses our dynasty
-...pray that Heaven blesses our dynasty

09:58.040 --> 09:59.880
-with a long reign.
-with a long reign.

09:59.880 --> 10:01.280
-May we have an abundant harvest.
-May we have an abundant harvest.

10:01.280 --> 10:03.000
-May the weather be favorable,
-May the weather be favorable,

10:03.000 --> 10:06.330
-and disasters be kept at bay.
-and disasters be kept at bay.

10:12.520 --> 10:14.180
Offer the shimmering elixir.

10:30.980 --> 10:31.780
Ah!

10:33.920 --> 10:35.080
What happened?

10:35.100 --> 10:36.290
We were just one step away.

10:36.290 --> 10:38.090
She must have done it on purpose.

10:39.570 --> 10:40.690
I'm sorry.

10:40.960 --> 10:41.520
Man.

10:41.520 --> 10:42.680
I'm sorry.

10:45.130 --> 10:46.350
Did you do it on purpose?

10:46.350 --> 10:47.450
I know you two don't get along,

10:47.450 --> 10:49.080
but you shouldn't
talk about her like that.

10:49.080 --> 10:50.560
At this point,

10:50.680 --> 10:52.540
she had no reason to lose her grip.

10:57.400 --> 10:58.440
Nan Yanzhi.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.000
You lose.

11:03.760 --> 11:04.280
Come.

11:04.280 --> 11:06.240
Jiang Man, get up.

11:06.780 --> 11:08.020
Come on, take it easy.

11:08.280 --> 11:09.960
Oh, come on.

11:12.640 --> 11:14.480
If it weren't for her,

11:15.400 --> 11:18.530
I might not have been able to beat you.

11:18.860 --> 11:19.820
President Wan,

11:19.850 --> 11:20.290
you...

11:21.220 --> 11:24.340
Jiang Man, I've got your back.

11:24.900 --> 11:26.440
There's no need to hide.

11:27.760 --> 11:28.640
Guards!

11:35.190 --> 11:36.200
Man!

11:37.160 --> 11:38.040
Yanzhi.

11:38.480 --> 11:39.800
Why did you do this?

11:39.880 --> 11:41.310
What is going on?

11:42.080 --> 11:43.160
I was right.

11:43.890 --> 11:45.230
She betrayed us!

11:45.320 --> 11:45.930
Man.

11:47.270 --> 11:48.760
Is what she said true?

11:50.170 --> 11:51.180
I'm sorry.

11:51.280 --> 11:52.120
We've been through
life and death together,

11:52.120 --> 11:54.720
and experienced so many
hardships to get here.

11:54.960 --> 11:56.840
Why did you do such a thing?

11:57.080 --> 11:59.010
I finally considered you a friend.

11:59.160 --> 12:01.080
How could you do this
at a matter of life and death?

12:01.080 --> 12:02.400
Why did you do it?

12:04.440 --> 12:06.680
I'm sorry, Dao.

12:07.720 --> 12:09.280
I let you down.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.800
I let all of you down.

12:13.800 --> 12:15.210
Jiang Man.

12:16.640 --> 12:18.770
You don't need to blame yourself.

12:18.840 --> 12:22.720
You are much more sensible

12:23.320 --> 12:25.130
than these stubborn fools.

12:25.160 --> 12:28.240
Don't worry. I will deliver

12:29.400 --> 12:30.800
on what I promised you.

12:31.320 --> 12:33.370
Wan Hongliu, you are despicable!

12:33.640 --> 12:34.720
Chilan Tuya.

12:35.480 --> 12:37.200
Are you jealous of me now?

12:37.840 --> 12:40.440
I gave all of you a chance.

12:40.830 --> 12:43.230
I'm afraid it's too late for regrets now.

12:43.560 --> 12:45.160
If you want someone to blame,

12:45.280 --> 12:46.560
blame yourself

12:47.600 --> 12:49.590
for insisting on taking her side.

12:53.290 --> 12:54.090
Man,

12:54.610 --> 12:56.160
I don't believe what she said.

12:56.160 --> 12:57.940
I want to hear it from you.

13:02.920 --> 13:04.040
Tell me!

13:04.250 --> 13:05.330
Yanzhi...

13:06.040 --> 13:06.730
Man,

13:07.270 --> 13:08.990
I treated you like a sister.

13:09.720 --> 13:12.280
Didn't we agree to leave here together?

13:12.640 --> 13:14.890
Why on earth did you do this?

13:17.720 --> 13:18.920
I want to live.

13:21.880 --> 13:23.080
I don't want to die.

13:26.400 --> 13:28.730
I've had enough of living in constant fear

13:29.640 --> 13:31.600
and going hungry

13:32.160 --> 13:34.040
every single day.

13:40.950 --> 13:42.750
Only by following President Wan

13:44.310 --> 13:46.390
can I live the life I want.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.610
This is the life I want.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.200
This is Lingya Tower.

13:52.080 --> 13:52.960
Get this straight.

13:52.960 --> 13:54.160
This is Lingya Tower.

13:54.160 --> 13:55.880
Do you want to stay here forever?

13:55.880 --> 13:57.160
Haha!

13:57.590 --> 13:59.500
Haha!

14:00.320 --> 14:02.980
Haha!

14:04.320 --> 14:05.520
Lingya Tower?

14:06.400 --> 14:08.440
Even if we get out, so what?

14:08.460 --> 14:11.140
The world outside is
just a bigger Lingya Tower.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.660
I have a lowly background.

14:12.880 --> 14:14.240
I'm not like you.

14:16.690 --> 14:19.750
No matter how hard I try,
I'm destined to be trampled on.

14:24.640 --> 14:25.640
Now,

14:29.310 --> 14:33.660
I just want to live
like a human before I die.

14:35.440 --> 14:36.400
You're wrong.

14:37.400 --> 14:40.860
Now you're truly living
like less than human.

14:44.090 --> 14:46.680
Enough. Take them away.

15:02.300 --> 15:03.350
Nan Yanzhi,

15:03.750 --> 15:05.480
you have no power or influence.

15:05.790 --> 15:07.350
You can't make any waves.

15:08.200 --> 15:11.840
Despite your best efforts,
you fell short in the end.

15:16.320 --> 15:17.780
Human nature is sinister.

15:18.440 --> 15:20.500
You've finally seen it for yourself.

15:22.590 --> 15:23.310
Wujiu.

15:29.340 --> 15:30.400
Since you're back,

15:30.400 --> 15:32.460
why didn't you report to me first?
